                                                    Restaurant Ordering Platform

A web-based restaurant ordering platform designed to make food ordering and restaurant management easier.

Features :
- User Registration and Login
- Digital Menu
- Online Food Ordering
- Shopping Cart
- Order History
- Table Reservation
- Customer Dashboard
- Profile Management
- Order Management

Technologies Used :
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Java
- MySQL
- JDBC

Project Structure :
The project contains frontend pages, Java backend files, and MySQL database components.

Database :
Database used: "restaurant_db"

Main tables include:
- Users
- Orders
- Reservations
- Menu

Purpose :
This project demonstrates the development of a restaurant ordering platform using frontend technologies, Java backend programming, and MySQL database connectivity.

Task :
This project is developed as Task 2 – Restaurant Ordering Platform.
